  "details": "Hey guys,I often switch worlds and I love exploring, but it's hard to find interesting ones when they're older. A lot of cool worlds get forgotten because of new releases. So here's an idea to fix that: add a new tab on the left called \"Timestamp\".Click it, and on the right you pick a year (like 2017 to 2025), then a calendar shows up. Click any day and the world list loads only the ones uploaded that exact day. It'd be perfect for digging up forgotten gems.\n\nI made two quick pics in paint to show it\n\nAnyone else think this would be useful? Or am I the only one missing easy access to nice old worlds?",
